# EmailJS Configuration for Longe Technologies Customer Enquiries & Job Applications
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g., Outlook connected to longetechnologies@outlook.com)
# 3. Create an Email Template with variables:
#    - {{customer_name}} or {{name}}
#    - {{customer_phone}} or {{phone}}
#    - {{customer_email}} or {{email}}
#    - {{service_center}} or {{branch}}
#    - {{service_needed}} or {{service}}
#    - {{position}} or {{job_position}}
#    - {{experience}}
#    - {{resume_name}}
#    - {{message}}
# 4. Copy your Service ID, Template ID, and Public Key below:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
# Optional dedicated template for hiring applications (defaults to VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID if omitted):
VITE_EMAILJS_CAREERS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=

